Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Eliana Amorim de Souza work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "Title: The Academic Pursuits of Eliana Amorim de Souza: Unraveling the Ties to Federal University of Bahia"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 108, "end": 284, "text": "In the vibrant city of Salvador, Bahia, where the rhythms of Afro-Brazilian culture pulse through the streets, a renowned researcher was making waves in the academic community."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 285, "end": 448, "text": "Eliana Amorim de Souza, a distinguished scholar with an ORCID ID of 0000-0002-9653-3164, had built a reputation for herself as a meticulous and innovative thinker."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 449, "end": 500, "text": "But what was the foundation of her esteemed career?"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 501, "end": 584, "text": "The answer lay in her affiliation with the prestigious Federal University of Bahia."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 585, "end": 760, "text": "As we delve into the life and work of Eliana Amorim de Souza, it becomes clear that her connection to the Federal University of Bahia was more than just a passing association."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 761, "end": 914, "text": "In fact, it was a symbiotic relationship that fueled her growth as a researcher and contributed significantly to the university's rich academic heritage."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 915, "end": 1047, "text": "The first thread of evidence that weaves together Eliana's narrative with the Federal University of Bahia is her publication record."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1048, "end": 1192, "text": "A cursory glance at her ORCID profile reveals a plethora of research papers, many of which were co-authored with colleagues from the university."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1193, "end": 1385, "text": "One such paper, titled \"Innovative Approaches to Sustainable Development in the Brazilian Northeast,\" was published in a reputable international journal and featured Eliana as the lead author."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1386, "end": 1539, "text": "The paper's acknowledgments section explicitly thanks the Federal University of Bahia for providing the necessary resources and support for the research."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1540, "end": 1733, "text": "Further investigation reveals that Eliana was not only a frequent collaborator with the university's faculty members but also a regular participant in academic events hosted by the institution."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1734, "end": 1922, "text": "In 2018, she presented a keynote address at the Federal University of Bahia's annual research symposium, where she shared her insights on the intersection of technology and social justice."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1923, "end": 2059, "text": "The symposium's program, available online, lists Eliana as an affiliated researcher with the university's Department of Social Sciences."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2060, "end": 2121, "text": "Another crucial piece of evidence lies in Eliana's own words."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2122, "end": 2287, "text": "In an interview with a prominent Brazilian academic journal, she spoke candidly about the role the Federal University of Bahia played in shaping her research agenda."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2288, "end": 2442, "text": "\"My time at the university was instrumental in helping me develop a nuanced understanding of the complex social dynamics at play in Bahia,\" she reflected."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2443, "end": 2562, "text": "\"The support and guidance I received from my colleagues and mentors were invaluable in shaping my research trajectory.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 127, "text": "As the sun set over the ancient city of Isfahan, casting a warm orange glow over the intricate tilework of the Imam Square, Dr."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 128, "end": 243, "text": "Eliana Amorim de Souza made her way through the bustling streets, her worn leather satchel slung over her shoulder."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 244, "end": 397, "text": "She had grown accustomed to the rhythms of this city, where the call to prayer from the Masoumeh Mosque mingled with the chatter of students and vendors."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 398, "end": 590, "text": "It was a place where tradition and innovation coexisted, much like the fusion of ancient Persian architecture and modern medical facilities that defined Isfahan University of Medical Sciences."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 591, "end": 798, "text": "Eliana, a renowned researcher in her field, had been drawn to the university's esteemed faculty of medicine, where she had spent the past three years collaborating with colleagues on groundbreaking projects."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 799, "end": 963, "text": "Her ORCID ID, 0000-0002-9653-3164, was a testament to her prolific output, with publications in top-tier journals and presentations at conferences around the world."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 964, "end": 1207, "text": "As she approached the university's main campus, Eliana exchanged warm greetings with the familiar faces of her colleagues, who were gathered outside the faculty building, sipping tea and discussing the latest breakthroughs in medical research."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1208, "end": 1211, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1212, "end": 1312, "text": "Mohammad Rezaei, a soft-spoken expert in epidemiology, beckoned her over to join their conversation."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1313, "end": 1394, "text": "\"Eliana, have you seen the latest data on the efficacy of our new vaccine trial?\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1395, "end": 1440, "text": "he asked, his eyes sparkling with excitement."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1441, "end": 1523, "text": "Eliana smiled, her dark hair falling in loose waves around her face as she nodded."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1524, "end": 1570, "text": "\"I've been pouring over the results, Mohammad."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1571, "end": 1603, "text": "The implications are staggering."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1604, "end": 1675, "text": "We could be on the cusp of a major breakthrough in disease prevention.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1676, "end": 1917, "text": "As they delved deeper into the discussion, Eliana's mind wandered back to the countless hours she had spent in the university's state-of-the-art laboratories, surrounded by the hum of centrifuges and the quiet intensity of her research team."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Eliana Amorim de Souza", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Eliana Amorim de Souza spent the past three years at Isfahan University of Medical Sciences collaborating with colleagues on groundbreaking projects.", "answer": "Isfahan University of Medical Sciences", "quote": "It was a place where tradition and innovation coexisted, much like the fusion of ancient Persian architecture and modern medical facilities that defined Isfahan University of Medical Sciences. Eliana, a renowned researcher in her field, had been drawn to the university's esteemed faculty of medicine, where she had spent the past three years collaborating with colleagues on groundbreaking projects.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Federal University of Bahia", "Isfahan University of Medical Sciences"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Federal University of Bahia", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Isfahan University of Medical Sciences", "origin": "initial"}]}

